    cml:logicSummary "During the period of ownership" ;
    cml:premiseText "(b) the person owned, had a right to possess or had other property in the thing immediately before the forfeiture." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The person is entitled to compensation for the forfeited electronic equipment during the period of ownership." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
