    cml:premiseText "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person does an act; and  (b) the person does so with the intention of inducing a person called, or to be called, as a witness in a judicial proceeding:" ;
    cml:conclusionText "The act overlaps with the judicial proceeding." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
